---
title: Deployment diagram - nodes, artefacts, environments and config sources (dashed = assumed)
---
flowchart TB
    subgraph DEV["Development environment (each developer PC)"]
        direction LR
        DEVWEB["«device» Developer PC<br>Vite dev server :5173<br>proxy /api -> :5151"]
        DEVAPI["«execution env» dotnet run<br>launch profile http :5151<br>ASPNETCORE_ENVIRONMENT = Development<br>Swagger on"]
        DEVDB[("«database» PostgreSQL<br>native :5432 or Docker smp-postgres<br>(docker-compose.yml postgres:15)")]
        EMU["«device» Android emulator<br>debug APK -> http://10.0.2.2:5151"]
        SECRETS[/"«config» .NET user-secrets<br>ConnectionStrings:DefaultConnection<br>Jwt:Key, Gemini:ApiKey"/]
        DEVWEB --> DEVAPI
        EMU --> DEVAPI
        DEVAPI --> DEVDB
        SECRETS -.-> DEVAPI
    end

    subgraph PROD["Production environment"]
        direction LR
        PAGESN["«node» GitHub Pages<br>artefact: strategies-web/dist<br>(vite build, base = repo path)"]
        APPSVC["«node» API host<br>ASSUMED Azure App Service<br>artefact: Strategies.Api (no publish workflow)"]
        SUPAN[("«node» Supabase PostgreSQL<br>migrated with dotnet ef from a dev PC<br>seeded via SQL editor")]
        APK["«artefact» release APK<br>API_BASE_URL = https://CHANGE-ME.example.com/<br>not built or distributed"]
        APPSET[/"«config» App Service settings<br>ConnectionStrings__DefaultConnection<br>Jwt__Key, Gemini__ApiKey, Smtp__*, App__BaseUrl<br>(ASSUMED: nothing in repo)"/]
        PAGESN -.->|"no VITE_API_BASE_URL at build"| APPSVC
        APK -.-> APPSVC
        APPSVC --> SUPAN
        APPSET -.-> APPSVC
    end

    subgraph CI["GitHub Actions runners (ubuntu-latest)"]
        BUILD["ci.yml: dotnet build/test, npm lint/test/build"]
        GHSEC[/"«config» GitHub secrets<br>JWT_KEY_CI (CI tests only)"/]
        DEPLOY["deploy-pages.yml: build + deploy-pages<br>on push to main"]
    end

    GHSEC -.-> BUILD
    DEPLOY -->|"github-pages environment"| PAGESN

    classDef assumed stroke-dasharray: 6 4,fill:#fafafa
    class APPSVC,APPSET,APK assumed
